  "reason": "HNX-SM4P halves: actual RTL pin capture / launch registers (rin / bin pin flops in hnx_rp4l_pinrow / pinbeat -- the S half has its OWN bin pinbeat u_pbs --, rout / bout launched by the hard row_e / beat_e cells, gin / gout by the gather registers, xs_* / xss_* through the five-stage straps); seam: sb_bank / sb_vld are the ring flops of ot_pl_land_w (N, flop -> pin) and land on the AND-OR -> flop of ot_pl_land_r (S, pin -> 1 mux level -> flop).  ONE root per half."
 },
