  "tag": "hnx_rp3lp3h_s",
  "purpose": "NEXT-release HBM die (OWNER 10-19 P3+(a), not a release gate): SM P = 3 tile hardened as two <= 2:1 halves (safe-design item 6); CRITICAL prefix hnx_rp3*: coordinator PNG review before any submit (report only).",
  "structural_change": "HNX-SM4P 10-20: hnx_rp3lp3x (630.72 x 2203.2, 3.49:1) split into two hardened halves along its lp regions: hnx_rp3lp3h_n 630.72 x 1209.6 (ck_n: leaf 0, row 0, bin beat path, N gather, seam ring) above hnx_rp3lp3h_s 630.72 x 1036.8 (ck_s: leaf 1, row 1, land_s on its own bin capture, seam read, S gather); the n->s seam is the 150-b gather landing only (D 4, E = K = 2, +3, as the lp record); the 2,069-b bin_l landing (4 dual-clock SRAMs) and the rl1_s / st_s pads (7 SRAMs) are removed (die fans bin out to both halves); compiler offsets identical to the flat lp record.",
